  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 7 (Monday, January 9, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. DUNCAN:\nH.R. 147.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8: This legislation establishes that\nbaseball is interstate commerce.\nSingle Subject Statement:\nThis legislation eliminates the antitrust exemption enjoyed\nby Major League Baseball.\n[Page H111]\n</pre>",
